UID:c38208f66caa0ef8@role-civil-litigation-appellate.maine-government-feeds
DTSTAMP:20260909T163703Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260909
SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Jury Scam Alert
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday\, September 9\, 2026\nJury Scam Alert\nThe U.S. Dist
 rict Court for the District of Maine is aware of an ongoing jury scam invo
 lving fraudulent text messages and emails claiming that recipients failed 
 to report for jury duty.  These messages falsely use the name of “Judge
  Nye” or other court officials.\nThese messages are not from the Court. 
  The Court will never send a text or email threatening arrest or demandin
 g payment for missed jury service.\nDo not respond\, provide personal or f
 inancial information\, click links\, or send payment in response to these 
 messages.  Jury Scams can be reported to Federal Trade Commission at Repo
 rtFraud.ftc.gov.\nhttps://www.med.uscourts.gov/news/jury-scam-alert
URL:https://www.med.uscourts.gov/news/jury-scam-alert
CATEGORIES:Curated Role Feeds
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
